From dca2b738065d7e602a621ed2d97bbcb984dc94ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiaimimi0920 <153103332+aiaimimi0920@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 19:46:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gif): add streaming exporter API

Preserve the legacy begin/write/end workflow while reusing the maintained giflib encoder and fixing alpha blending, memory safety, dithering, and loop control.

Godot-Patch-Topic: media.gif-streaming-exporter
